There are a lot of factions in Bitcoin. The payments crowd. The store of value crowd. The institutional crowd. The self-custody crowd.

@samcallah of @OranjeBTC made a great point at BitGo's High Roller Summit: they're not competing. 

They're all driving adoption at the same time.

